OL,3,AProtesters across Spain demand action
OL,4,Aover housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There is a lot of anger in the
OL,7,Fstreets," said a spokesperson for the
OL,8,FValencia Tenants' Union, where a
OL,9,Fdemonstration has already started.
OL,10,FClashes have taken place between some
OL,11,Fprotesters and police in the city.
OL,13,FThe measures put forward by Pedro
OL,14,FSanchez's leftist coalition government
OL,15,Fon Friday followed public outcry over
OL,16,Fthe eviction of an 87-year-old woman
OL,17,Ffrom her home last month after she was
OL,18,Funable to afford a sharp rent increase.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
